@startuml RAG Pipeline Sequence Diagram
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxMessageSize 60
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

title DocLingo RAG Pipeline - Sequence Diagram

actor User
participant "PDF Loader" as Loader
participant "Text Extractor" as Extractor
participant "Document Chunker" as Chunker
participant "Embedding Manager" as EmbeddingMgr
participant "FAISS Index" as FAISS
participant "FAISS Retriever" as Retriever
participant "Answer Generator" as Generator
participant "OpenAI API" as OpenAI

== Document Indexing Phase ==

User -> Loader: Upload PDF Document
Loader -> Extractor: Extract Text from PDF
Extractor -> Chunker: Pages (List[str])
Chunker -> Chunker: Split into chunks\n(500 chars, 50 overlap)
Chunker -> Chunker: Add metadata\n(page numbers, positions)

Chunker -> EmbeddingMgr: Chunks (List[str])
activate EmbeddingMgr
EmbeddingMgr -> OpenAI: Batch Embedding Request\n(text-embedding-3-small)
OpenAI -> EmbeddingMgr: Embeddings (numpy array)
deactivate EmbeddingMgr

EmbeddingMgr -> FAISS: Chunks + Embeddings + Metadata
activate FAISS
FAISS -> FAISS: Normalize embeddings
FAISS -> FAISS: Add to IndexFlatL2
FAISS -> FAISS: Store chunks & metadata
deactivate FAISS

FAISS --> User: Index Ready

== Query Processing Phase ==

User -> Retriever: Submit Query
activate Retriever

Retriever -> EmbeddingMgr: Generate Query Embedding
activate EmbeddingMgr
EmbeddingMgr -> OpenAI: Embed Query Text
OpenAI -> EmbeddingMgr: Query Embedding Vector
deactivate EmbeddingMgr

Retriever -> FAISS: Search Similar Vectors\n(query_embedding, k=5)
activate FAISS
FAISS -> FAISS: Calculate L2 distances
FAISS -> FAISS: Find Top-K nearest neighbors
FAISS -> Retriever: Results with scores & metadata
deactivate FAISS

Retriever -> Retriever: Filter by score threshold\n(optional)
Retriever -> Retriever: Apply metadata filters\n(optional)
Retriever -> Retriever: Extract chunks + metadata

Retriever -> Generator: Retrieved Chunks\n+ Query + Answer Language
activate Generator

Generator -> Generator: Normalize chunks format
Generator -> Generator: Format context with citations
Generator -> Generator: Build system prompt\n(language-aware, grounded)
Generator -> Generator: Build user prompt\n(query + context)

Generator -> OpenAI: Chat Completion Request\n(GPT-4o-mini)
activate OpenAI
OpenAI -> Generator: Generated Answer\n(grounded in context)
deactivate OpenAI

Generator -> Generator: Validate answer grounding
Generator --> User: Final Answer\n(with citations)
deactivate Generator
deactivate Retriever

@enduml


